%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: GetDaNewSword
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767205
    - rid: 268100043383767206
    - rid: 268100043383767212
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: First things first, gotta check out my new sword.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767208
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767209
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey Eorlund, is my sword ready?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767210
    - rid: 268100043383767211
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Aye. I hope it's to your liking.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Eorlund hands me the sword.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100066478391296
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I twist it around in my hands, trying to get a feel for the different
      weight.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Once I deem it satisfactory, I place it in the sheath Eorlund gave me
      along with the sword.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I gesture to the weapon I've had since Helgen-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You mind buying this thing off of me?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Pass it here and I'll appraise it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I do as instructed, handing it over to Eorlund.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm. It's a bit chipped here and the leather bindings are a bit frayed
      here.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: It appears to have gone through a year of battle unserviced; why have
      you not taken this to a smith for maintenance?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, well, I've only had it for four days now, so you'd have to ask the
      previous owner who's probably been dead for just as long.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Hmm...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Based on the poor condition, I can give you 10 septims for it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: To be honest, I just want it off my hands, so deal.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The exchange is finished, with Eorlund handing me the 10 promised proper
      pieces of payment.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100066478391298
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Will that be all?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Is Natsuki not working with you today?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100066478391299
    - rid: 268100066478391302
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Huh, Monika has a point. Where <i>is</i> Natsuki?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100066478391300
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, she and the other members of the Circle left town just before the
      dawn.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100066478391303
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Not sure where they're off to, but it probably has something to deal
      with Kodlak's death.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100066478391301
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... Kodlak died already?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'Natsuki only <i>just</i> did the "turn into a werewolf" quest yesterday,
      right? '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There should be at least one more quest of working with Aela and the
      witches head quest before the Silver Hand assault Jorrvaskr.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Strange...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'All known instances of this... "story" going off-script, seemingly without
      our intervention:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Farkas using his werewolf form more than once...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Kodlak dying early...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I should check in with Sayori and Yuri to see if anything's off on
      their end when I see them again.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Although, it might not matter if we head back home after I defeat Alduin.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you know which direction they're heading?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: From up here, I saw them moving southwest.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: What's in that direction, that the Companions would be interested in...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Is the witch coven in that direction? I don't remember...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Do you have an idea of what they're up to, {mc}?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Either they're going to murder a bunch of Silver Hand, or a bunch of
      witches.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (No matter what, it's a safe bet that murder's involved.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100066478391304
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Yikes...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100066478391305
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, tell her we said hi if you see her around.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100066478391306
    - rid: 268100066478391307
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of us take our leave of Eorlund, heading toward the barracks
      to grab a couple of guys for our cause.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100066478391308
    - rid: 268100066478391309
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
